{"articleNo":"2359","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2359&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"제71회 교내 모의토익시험 고사장 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.12","hit":"13752","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"style3\"><span class=\"style3\"><span class=\"style3\"><font color=\"#666666\"><strong><font size=\"2\">제71회 교내 모의토익시험 고사장을 아래와 같이 알려드립니다.</font></strong>&nbsp; </font>\n<p align=\"left\">* 일&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 : 2009년 11월 14일(토) 오전9시.</p>\n<p align=\"left\">*&nbsp;고사장&nbsp;:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;1번 ~ 45번&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;디지털관 321호</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;46번 ~ 90번&nbsp;&nbsp; 디지털관 323호</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 91번 ~ 135번&nbsp;&nbsp; 디지털관 326호</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 136번 ~ 180번&nbsp;&nbsp; 디지털관 327호</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;181번 ~ 225번&nbsp;&nbsp; 디지털관 423호</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;226번 ~ 끝번&nbsp;&nbsp; 디지털관 434호<br>* 준비물 : 신분증, 연필 혹은 싸인펜</p>\n<p align=\"left\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\"> (신분증 미지참시 시험에 응시할수 없습니다. 꼭 지참바랍니다.)</font></p>\n<p align=\"left\">* 9시까지 고사실에 입실하셔야 합니다.</p>\n<p align=\"left\">* 기타문의 : 어학교육원 행정실(478-7223)</p>\n</span></span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
